    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Aeth rhywbeth o'i le a dydy eich PIN ddim ar gael.
  \errors\NoPinText:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Gallwch ailosod eich PIN drwy fynd i Gosodiadau > Cyfrifon > Dewisiadau mewngofnodi.
  \errors\NoNetworkVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: You will need the Internet for this. It does not look like you are connected to the Internet. Check your connection and try again.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaTitle:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Byddwch chi angen y rhyngrwyd ar gyfer hyn.
  \errors\NoNetworkMsaText:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Nid yw'n ymddangos eich bod wedi cysylltu i'r rhyngrwyd. Gwiriwch eich cysylltiad a rhoi cynnig arall arni.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedVoiceOver:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: We cannot open that page right now. For security reasons, you will need to visit the page from a browser or a different device.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedTitle:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Does dim modd agor y dudalen honno ar hyn o bryd.
  \errors\NavigationBlockedText:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Am resymau diogelwch, bydd angen i chi fynd i'r dudalen o borwr neu ar ddyfais wahanol. Os ydych chi'n credu eich bod chi wedi cyrraedd y dudalen hon oherwydd gwall, dywedwch wrth gymorth TG eich sefydliad nad ydych chi'n gallu cael mynediad at {0}
  \errors\LocalAccount:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Anwybyddu
