    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Canslo
  \errors\BlockedByPolicyMSATitle:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Methu mewngofnodi gyda chyfrif Microsoft
  \errors\AccountText:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Does dim modd i ni eich mewngofnodi ar hyn o bryd. Rhowch gynnig arall arni, neu dewiswch Anwybyddu i fewngofnodi rywbryd eto.
