    Candidate Language=CY-GB: &Yn ôl
  \cortana\setCortanaOptOut:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Not now
  \cortana\privacyStatement:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Privacy statement
  \cortana\learnMoreLink:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Learn more
  \cortana\learnMoreHeadline:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Cortana
  \cortana\learnMoreBody2:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Learn more about Cortana in the Privacy Statement (https://aka.ms/privacy) and in the Cortana Learn more (https://aka.ms/cortanafaq).
  \cortana\learnMoreBody:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Cortana is your personal assistant. Cortana works best when you sign in and let it learn about you and your activities by using data from your device, your personal Microsoft account, third-party services and other Microsoft services. To help Cortana to provide personalized experiences and relevant suggestions, you can let Microsoft collect and use various types of data, such as your device location, data from your calendar, the apps you use, data from your emails and text messages, who you call, your contacts and who you interact with on your device. When you are signed in, Cortana also learns about you by collecting data about how you use your device and other Microsoft services, such as your music, alarm settings, whether the lock screen is on, what you view and purchase, your browsing in Microsoft Edge and Bing search history, and more. You can manage what data Cortana uses, and what it knows about you in Cortana Settings, Notebook and Permissions. You can always sign out of Cortana, and when you do, Cortana will still be there to help, but your experiences will not be personalized.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText3:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: A dweud y gwir, dwi'n gynorthwyydd personol i chi ac <br/>yn barod i gychwyn arni.
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText2:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: I'm your searcher, finder, weather watcher, plan-aheader, note taker, reminder maker, and animal impersonator (if you ever need that).
  \cortana\cortanaPersonaText:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Helo, Cortana <br/>ydw i a dwi yma i wneud pethau'n haws a'ch helpu chi i wneud pethau.
  \cortana\cortanaNextButton:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Use Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaIntro:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Meet Cortana
  \cortana\cortanaContent:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Cortana yw eich partner, yn barod i helpu gyda beth sy’n eich gwneud yn arch arwr, yn arwrol, neu ddim ond yn brydlon.<br/><br/>Er mwyn i Cortana allu darparu profiadau wedi'u personoli ac awgrymiadau perthnasol mae Microsoft yn casglu a defnyddio gwybodaeth yn cynnwys eich lleoliad a hanes lleoliad, cysylltiadau, mewnbwn llais, patrymau llais a llawysgrifen, hanes teipio, hanes chwilio, manylion calendr, cynnwys a hanes cyfathrebu o negeseuon ac apiau, a gwybodaeth arall o'ch dyfais. Yn Microsoft Edge, mae Cortana yn casglu a defnyddio eich hanes chwilio. Mae'n ddigon hawdd i chi addasu beth mae Cortana yn ei gofio yn y Llyfr Nodiadau ac analluogi Cortana yn Microsoft Edge.
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptTitle:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Rhowch eich cyfrinair
  \cloudDomainJoin\CredPromptCaption:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: Ar gyfer diogelwch, rhowch eich cyfrinair unwaith eto.
  \MicrosoftInternalMetadata\ContentChecksumValue:
    Candidate Language=CY-GB: 2532485720
